# Key script for tools/check_quality_growth.sh, INCURSION_QUALITY_CLASS_PROBE=grow
# (src/QualityClassProbe.cpp; inc-mafd8). The answers, in the order the probe asks:
#   site 4, weapon  CraftItem (Augment): q "Add quality", a the one candidate
#                   (the light mace), the quality menu is dumped, ESC aborts
#   site 5, x1      the Oil of Transformation "Select a New Form" menu: long sword
# The final search is one real turn, so tools/headless.sh counts a session.
q
a
@dump:offer-weapon
ESC
@choose "long sword"
@dump:arrival

s
@dump:played
